    "title": "Building Zero-Trust AI Agents with Google's Agent Development Kit",
    "dek": "To safely allow autonomous AI agents built with Google's Agent Development Kit to mutate production state, software teams must replace soft system prompts with hard security boundaries like gVisor sandboxing and cryptographic verification.",
    "category": "artificial-intelligence",
