    "title": "Google Releases TPU Microbenchmarks for Granular Performance Tuning",
    "dek": "Google's open-source TPU microbenchmark suite allows machine learning engineers to isolate hardware subsystems, build empirical Roofline models, and target compiler-level optimizations.",
